The fourth item shows a pipeline and its output and asks the student to
explain how the number came out.
The stem glosses the two programs, so that not knowing [[grep]] does not
stop the account; what we want is the student's picture of what goes on
between the two programs, which is where the conceptions of
\cref{sec:composition}---the pipe as a file, as a sequence, as a
stream---show themselves unprompted.

